{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212300","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212300","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1421230001:0":{"text":"咳咳，有人能看到这段留言吗？测试，测试……","source_cn":"咳咳，有人能看到这段留言吗？测试，测试……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F92BF3B2278B7F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421230002:1":{"text":"这是我第一次试录，应该没问题吧？","source_cn":"这是我第一次试录，应该没问题吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A9F18DD12F0A60D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421230003:1":{"text":"唔，我得对自己的水平有点信心！斐利尔肯定没问题！","source_cn":"唔，我得对自己的水平有点信心！斐利尔肯定没问题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC824616EE6DC4167","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421230004:1":{"text":"哇，我刚刚说的那段是不是被记录下来了……糟糕，怎么删除啊！","source_cn":"哇，我刚刚说的那段是不是被记录下来了……糟糕，怎么删除啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E876727CA968A63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421230005:1":{"text":"算了算了，也不一定有人看，先就这样吧！下面开始说正事——","source_cn":"算了算了，也不一定有人看，先就这样吧！下面开始说正事——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83E08F6B67B9E259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421230006:1":{"text":"嘿嘿，如果你们看到这个，说明已经找到我的实验林地啦！","source_cn":"嘿嘿，如果你们看到这个，说明已经找到我的实验林地啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC13A88198469773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421230007:1":{"text":"那里是不是很漂亮？我可是花了好多心思呢。","source_cn":"那里是不是很漂亮？我可是花了好多心思呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70F9452FB7B6AC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421230008:1":{"text":"为了奖励你们的发现，我要送你们一些礼物！","source_cn":"为了奖励你们的发现，我要送你们一些礼物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D3467FE797D7D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421230009:1":{"text":"听好啦！我在一个特别特别隐秘的地方藏了一些宝物——","source_cn":"听好啦！我在一个特别特别隐秘的地方藏了一些宝物——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8819D477F60CA36F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421230010:1":{"text":"别觉得我突然大方呢，只是能破解我的魔法找到那里的人，一定是我的好朋友！","source_cn":"别觉得我突然大方呢，只是能破解我的魔法找到那里的人，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC4FB0C67516DF33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421230011:0":{"text":"嘿嘿，你们加油！要是找到宝藏，记得跟我说好厉害！","source_cn":"嘿嘿，你们加油！要是找到宝藏，记得跟我说好厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3F9A3309F3135CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1421230012:0":{"text":"回忆影像消失，所有人也陷入了沉默……","source_cn":"回忆影像消失，所有人也陷入了沉默……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AEE10C98DDC17C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421230013:1":{"text":"……就算是这种时候，还在炫耀自己的魔法能力。","source_cn":"……就算是这种时候，还在炫耀自己的魔法能力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE6F1C6925CDFAFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421230014:1":{"text":"……真是个幼稚鬼。","source_cn":"……真是个幼稚鬼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22EF3799611B346A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421230015:1":{"text":"呜呜，斐利尔大人……","source_cn":"呜呜，斐利尔大人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE0F3D9511C23CAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421230016:1":{"text":"我、我好想你……","source_cn":"我、我好想你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09EFA55C70D8F9E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_ma